[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14760.07, "timestamp": "04:06:00", "text": "糟了，这条路走错了。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14763.11, "timestamp": "04:06:03", "text": "带你们走到今天。妈的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14765.91, "timestamp": "04:06:05", "text": "不要从这里跳下去。我再说一遍，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14768.07, "timestamp": "04:06:08", "text": "不要跳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14770.469, "timestamp": "04:06:10", "text": "那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14772.389, "timestamp": "04:06:12", "text": "是啊，我当时就想，“哇，这看起来很多。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14776.07, "timestamp": "04:06:16", "text": "熟悉的。”那是我儿子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14778.389, "timestamp": "04:06:18", "text": "小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14784.389, "timestamp": "04:06:24", "text": "方法。嗯，你稍等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14794.15, "timestamp": "04:06:34", "text": "此外，直播内容已经完全追上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14797.03, "timestamp": "04:06:37", "text": "什么？哦，那真不错。我死了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14800.95, "timestamp": "04:06:40", "text": "没死。哦，你死了。所以，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14804.07, "timestamp": "04:06:44", "text": "死亡后，你会在哪里重生？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14807.83, "timestamp": "04:06:47", "text": "是的，我已经回到我睡觉的地方了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14810.71, "timestamp": "04:06:50", "text": "哇。你的物品丢失了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14819.71, "timestamp": "04:06:59", "text": "哇。哦，我到达了某个地方。"}]